# Prompt 3 — Frontend Polish + Design QA

Review the BugPilot AI frontend as a senior product designer and frontend engineer.

Do not add new major features.

Audit:
- Visual hierarchy
- Spacing consistency
- Typography
- Button hierarchy
- Input readability
- Code editor usability
- Result readability
- Empty/loading/error states
- Responsive layout
- Accessibility
- Long text/code overflow

Make the UI feel cohesive and production-ready while preserving the existing architecture.

Important:
- Keep the interface simple.
- Do not introduce unnecessary cards, decorative sections, or animations.
- Ensure the primary action "Analyze Bug" is visually obvious.
- Ensure the result sections are easy to scan.
- Ensure the app still looks good at common desktop and mobile widths.

Run the project after your changes and fix any issues you find.
